About the Author:
Eng. Salah Allsayani is a Senior Full Stack Software Engineer and AI Engineer 
graduated from Taiz University, Alsaeed Faculty of Engineering & IT, Yemen.
With a career spanning full-stack development, cloud architecture, DevOps, 
security engineering, and AI/ML system design, Eng. Salah brings deep expertise 
in orchestrating complex multi-agent software development workflows, SDLC 
automation, and enterprise-grade platform architecture.

His work focuses on bridging the gap between AI-powered development and 
traditional software engineering best practices, creating systems that 
leverage the strengths of both human and artificial intelligence to deliver 
high-quality, maintainable, and scalable software solutions.

